WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
01:38.470 --> 01:43.940
[Small Town Remedy]

4
01:44.270 --> 01:46.729
[Episode 7]

5
01:47.479 --> 01:48.350
President!

6
01:49.509 --> 01:51.400
I went to your place to look for you,

7
01:51.400 --> 01:52.200
but you were not there.

8
01:52.200 --> 01:52.640
So I guessed

9
01:52.640 --> 01:54.570
you must be working overtime here.

10
01:56.000 --> 01:57.400
How did you get so blotto?

11
01:57.640 --> 01:58.710
Didn't I go as you

12
01:58.710 --> 01:59.590
instructed?

13
01:59.870 --> 02:01.330
I was with Liu Zhengliang.

14
02:01.950 --> 02:02.870
Let me report to you

15
02:02.870 --> 02:03.840
about this Liu Zhengliang.

16
02:03.840 --> 02:05.710
Guess how he reacted at dinner?

17
02:06.200 --> 02:07.000
He stood up

18
02:07.150 --> 02:08.190
and left!

19
02:08.360 --> 02:09.150
Oh, my...

20
02:09.360 --> 02:12.280
H-He's got quite a personality.

21
02:12.360 --> 02:13.910
He said, "I can't drink."

22
02:14.240 --> 02:16.030
He really couldn't take even a single sip.

23
02:16.030 --> 02:16.710
And I said, "You..."

24
02:16.710 --> 02:17.470
Can you tell me

25
02:17.470 --> 02:18.800
something I don't know?

26
02:26.800 --> 02:29.329
Mingming and Zhang Hao are getting a divorce.

27
02:30.280 --> 02:31.520
The point is that I have no idea

28
02:31.520 --> 02:33.050
when they even got married!

29
02:34.000 --> 02:35.120
Long, did you know?

30
02:36.400 --> 02:38.260
What's there to make a fuss about?

31
02:45.400 --> 02:46.360
What happened?

32
02:47.420 --> 02:50.490
[Harmony in Diversity]

33
02:47.870 --> 02:48.630
Later,

34
02:51.750 --> 02:52.910
he shacked up

35
02:54.310 --> 02:55.800
with that woman.

36
02:57.870 --> 03:00.750
The two of them lived off collecting rent.

37
03:02.150 --> 03:02.870
They did nothing

38
03:02.870 --> 03:04.270
other than play mahjong.

39
03:05.430 --> 03:06.310
And then,

40
03:08.710 --> 03:11.310
he also broke up with that woman

41
03:13.240 --> 03:15.240
and kept hooking up with new people.

42
03:20.240 --> 03:21.030
That was

43
03:23.150 --> 03:24.880
exactly when my mom passed away

44
03:26.590 --> 03:28.390
from a relapse of breast cancer.

45
03:32.360 --> 03:34.760
He infuriated my mom and drove her to death.

46
03:37.680 --> 03:39.590
You must hate his guts now.

47
03:41.430 --> 03:41.910
Yep.

48
03:52.360 --> 03:54.590
I'm not asking you to repay hatred with kindness.

49
03:54.590 --> 03:56.990
I wonder if you've ever thought about this.

50
03:57.000 --> 03:58.680
If he dies here today

51
03:58.680 --> 04:00.280
because you refused to sign,

52
04:01.240 --> 04:03.240
you'll carry that burden for the rest of your life,

53
04:03.240 --> 04:04.700
which will be hard to bear.

54
04:08.240 --> 04:09.470
I won't regret it.

55
04:12.080 --> 04:13.940
I just want to take revenge on him.

56
04:14.430 --> 04:15.360
I see.

57
04:17.360 --> 04:18.220
Alright, then,

58
04:18.750 --> 04:19.720
let's talk about

59
04:19.720 --> 04:21.180
how to take revenge on him.

60
04:24.560 --> 04:25.630
Right now,

61
04:25.720 --> 04:27.050
he can't feel anything.

62
04:28.720 --> 04:29.800
If he just dies this way,

63
04:29.800 --> 04:31.060
he'll get off too easy.

64
04:32.560 --> 04:34.290
Let me tell you a little secret.

65
04:34.750 --> 04:36.240
At his age,

66
04:37.120 --> 04:38.480
even if the surgery

67
04:40.270 --> 04:41.040
cures him,

68
04:41.040 --> 04:42.950
his womanizing days will be over.

69
04:44.750 --> 04:46.750
Living like this is actually

70
04:47.000 --> 04:48.870
worse than death for him.

71
04:50.159 --> 04:50.720
He might

72
04:50.720 --> 04:52.240
even come to you

73
04:53.390 --> 04:55.070
and use the family ties

74
04:56.120 --> 04:58.320
to seek some father-daughter comfort.

75
04:58.920 --> 05:00.320
You must not forgive him.

76
05:00.510 --> 05:01.600
Just let him

77
05:01.600 --> 05:03.480
endure this all alone.

78
05:03.870 --> 05:04.870
The older he gets, the lonelier

79
05:04.870 --> 05:06.530
and more miserable he will be.

80
05:06.720 --> 05:08.780
Wouldn't that b-be more satisfying?

81
05:22.520 --> 05:26.040
[Reserve Medical Equipment]

82
05:37.950 --> 05:39.720
Tell the 4th-floor staff to get ready immediately.

83
05:38.340 --> 05:47.210
[Reserve Medical Equipment]

84
05:42.310 --> 05:43.430
How did you pull this off?

85
05:43.430 --> 05:44.480
I don't know either.

86
05:44.480 --> 05:46.010
I've talked myself hoarse.

87
06:01.000 --> 06:02.600
-One, two, go. -One, two, go.

88
06:33.950 --> 06:34.950
Son, you're back.

89
06:36.360 --> 06:37.620
Why is your face so red?

90
06:38.159 --> 06:38.920
Are you freezing

91
06:38.920 --> 06:40.190
or having a fever?

92
06:40.190 --> 06:42.190
It's from the strong gusts outside.

93
06:42.430 --> 06:43.430
Hurry, come on in.

94
06:58.920 --> 06:59.720
You didn't

95
07:00.310 --> 07:01.390
go to work all day.

96
07:02.000 --> 07:02.920
I don't know what you've been

97
07:02.920 --> 07:04.450
fooling around with today.

98
07:04.480 --> 07:05.750
I wasn't fooling around.

99
07:04.780 --> 07:07.350
[999 Cold Medicine]

100
07:07.430 --> 07:08.560
I took the day off.

101
07:08.680 --> 07:09.430
Chen Junnan,

102
07:09.430 --> 07:11.160
look at your attitude now.

103
07:11.430 --> 07:13.040
Do you want to quit or what?

104
07:13.040 --> 07:14.190
What attitude?

105
07:14.360 --> 07:15.390
Didn't I tell you before?

106
07:15.390 --> 07:16.430
If you want to quit, what else can you do?

107
07:16.430 --> 07:17.000
What are you capable of?

108
07:17.000 --> 07:18.160
I can do anything!

109
07:18.270 --> 07:18.870
As long as I'm

110
07:18.870 --> 07:19.920
not working under your nose,

111
07:19.920 --> 07:21.000
I can do anything!

112
07:21.430 --> 07:22.430
If I do well,

113
07:22.430 --> 07:24.190
people think I'm riding on your coat-tails.

114
07:24.190 --> 07:26.040
If I don't do well,

115
07:27.430 --> 07:28.360
I embarrass you.

116
07:28.360 --> 07:29.390
So what if you ride on my coat-tails?

117
07:29.390 --> 07:30.920
You're benefiting from me!

118
07:31.160 --> 07:32.750
Others want to but can't.

119
07:32.750 --> 07:34.000
Don't complain!

120
07:34.159 --> 07:36.220
You've got your father to back you up.

121
07:36.240 --> 07:37.480
You should consider yourself lucky!

122
07:37.480 --> 07:38.390
I don't need it.

123
07:39.270 --> 07:41.070
I can make a living off anything.

124
07:42.240 --> 07:42.920
I...

125
07:43.159 --> 07:44.360
Then what do you want?

126
07:44.720 --> 07:45.800
I wasn't joking before.

127
07:45.800 --> 07:47.430
I just want to resign...

128
07:49.360 --> 07:50.490
and join Xiaoximen.

129
07:57.720 --> 07:58.510
Come on.

130
07:58.720 --> 08:00.040
Take this cold medicine now.

131
08:00.040 --> 08:01.100
Don't catch a cold.

132
08:01.390 --> 08:02.450
Careful, it's hot.

133
08:04.160 --> 08:05.720
G-Go drink it back in your room.

134
08:05.720 --> 08:06.600
Go ahead.

135
08:06.600 --> 08:07.920
Look how freezing you are.

136
08:07.920 --> 08:08.390
Go.

137
08:09.720 --> 08:12.450
Are you sure you want to join Xiaoximen Hospital?

138
08:16.360 --> 08:17.160
I'm sure.

139
08:26.310 --> 08:27.310
What did I say?

140
08:27.720 --> 08:29.920
Junnan wasn't just talking out of anger.

141
08:29.920 --> 08:31.600
He went to visit Liu Zhengliang last time

142
08:31.600 --> 08:32.909
and came back telling us

143
08:32.909 --> 08:34.720
that Liu Zhengliang was very excellent, right?

144
08:34.720 --> 08:36.030
But the point is that

145
08:36.120 --> 08:37.150
Liu Zhengliang is

146
08:37.150 --> 08:38.320
way too outstanding.

147
08:38.320 --> 08:39.360
Word of his surgery

148
08:39.360 --> 08:41.220
has spread all over our hospital.

149
08:41.360 --> 08:43.360
That surgery was so hard that I-I...

150
08:43.440 --> 08:44.670
Even I couldn't do it.

151
08:45.840 --> 08:47.000
Technically,

152
08:47.000 --> 08:48.550
t-this is a good thing.

153
08:48.600 --> 08:49.480
It is a good thing.

154
08:49.480 --> 08:50.630
But if the two of them work together,

155
08:50.630 --> 08:51.360
by comparison,

156
08:51.360 --> 08:53.000
he'll be outshone obviously

157
08:53.000 --> 08:54.510
and look bad!

158
08:54.840 --> 08:56.300
Right now in our hospital,

159
08:56.480 --> 08:57.550
I can take care of him.

160
08:57.550 --> 08:58.480
If he goes to Xiaoximen,

161
08:58.480 --> 08:59.750
who will look after him?

162
08:59.750 --> 09:01.510
If he can't figure out how to treat patients,

163
09:01.510 --> 09:02.200
what will he do?

164
09:02.200 --> 09:03.030
If he can't finish the surgery

165
09:03.030 --> 09:05.160
in the operating room, what will he do?

166
09:08.550 --> 09:09.480
How about this?

167
09:10.150 --> 09:11.960
I'll invite Zhengliang over

168
09:11.960 --> 09:13.670
for dinner someday.

169
09:13.870 --> 09:15.270
You can have a good talk with him

170
09:15.270 --> 09:16.720
and ask him to guide Junnan.

171
09:16.720 --> 09:17.480
Is that okay?

172
09:18.670 --> 09:20.480
Alright, that's the only way.

173
09:20.670 --> 09:24.860
[Beiji Pharmacy]

174
09:26.180 --> 09:28.010
[Divorce Certificate] [Holder: Zhang Hao]

175
09:28.060 --> 09:30.280
[Holder: Che Mingming]

176
09:43.310 --> 09:44.030
[Marriage Registration Office of Tiedong District Civil Affairs Bureau]

177
09:51.390 --> 09:53.000
Where are you going? I can give you a ride.

178
09:53.000 --> 09:54.660
No, thanks. I'll take the bus.

179
10:04.840 --> 10:05.500
Time to eat.

180
10:19.440 --> 10:20.570
Time for lunch, Dad!

181
10:27.870 --> 10:29.550
What are you doing? Lunch is ready.

182
10:29.550 --> 10:31.390
Things have gotten complicated.

183
10:31.390 --> 10:32.520
Haven't you noticed

184
10:32.840 --> 10:33.870
that the glass marble I put here

185
10:33.870 --> 10:34.550
is gone?

186
10:35.030 --> 10:35.790
Seems like the enemy

187
10:35.790 --> 10:37.120
has already found our home.

188
10:37.120 --> 10:38.150
We must move!

189
10:38.440 --> 10:39.150
We're leaving right away!

190
10:39.150 --> 10:39.600
No.

191
10:40.120 --> 10:41.440
I took it to my office.

192
10:42.440 --> 10:43.200
Where did you take it?

193
10:43.200 --> 10:45.200
Do you know what's hidden inside it?

194
10:45.630 --> 10:47.150
It contains the key chip

195
10:47.150 --> 10:49.200
to our organization's account.

196
10:49.200 --> 10:50.670
All our emergency funds

197
10:50.670 --> 10:52.000
are in this account.

198
10:52.510 --> 10:53.480
The key is lost.

199
10:53.510 --> 10:54.870
How can I explain this to the organization?

200
10:54.870 --> 10:56.510
How can I explain this to Comrade Xiaobo?

201
10:56.510 --> 10:57.240
Come to eat!

202
10:57.630 --> 10:58.490
I'm not eating!

203
10:58.840 --> 11:00.240
You've really messed up.

204
11:00.790 --> 11:01.630
I'll go to the hospital tomorrow

205
11:01.630 --> 11:02.890
and get it back for you.

206
11:03.030 --> 11:03.720
Okay, then.

207
11:22.750 --> 11:23.440
I'm eating.

208
11:23.750 --> 11:24.680
I'll contact you

209
11:24.750 --> 11:25.610
after I finish.

210
11:25.630 --> 11:26.150
Over.

211
11:37.710 --> 11:39.400
[Quiet]

212
11:39.400 --> 11:41.270
[Ward 2]

213
11:43.320 --> 11:44.270
How are you recovering today?

214
11:44.270 --> 11:44.960
Any better?

215
11:45.120 --> 11:46.180
I feel much better.

216
11:46.510 --> 11:48.110
My head doesn't hurt as much.

217
11:48.270 --> 11:50.080
I can see much more clearly.

218
11:50.360 --> 11:51.420
Thank you, doctor.

219
11:51.840 --> 11:53.840
Looks like you're recovering well.

220
11:54.150 --> 11:54.960
Porridge?

221
11:55.480 --> 11:56.270
Yes.

222
11:56.360 --> 11:57.120
You can have

223
11:57.120 --> 11:58.240
some liquid food today.

224
11:58.240 --> 11:59.320
But don't eat too much.

225
11:59.320 --> 11:59.960
If you feel

226
11:59.960 --> 12:01.270
a bit better later,

227
12:01.270 --> 12:03.030
you can get out of bed and move around a bit.

228
12:03.030 --> 12:04.510
Don't lie in bed all the time.

229
12:04.510 --> 12:06.200
It's not very good for regaining

230
12:06.200 --> 12:06.910
your mobility.

231
12:06.910 --> 12:07.550
Okay,

232
12:07.840 --> 12:08.630
thank you.

233
12:08.840 --> 12:10.170
Alright, get some rest.

234
12:14.790 --> 12:15.440
I see you're

235
12:15.440 --> 12:16.770
recovering quite well.

236
12:17.360 --> 12:19.220
You're even playing video games.

237
12:19.320 --> 12:20.520
Get discharged soon.

238
12:21.360 --> 12:22.630
I'm not getting discharged.

239
12:22.630 --> 12:23.360
If I get discharged,

240
12:23.360 --> 12:24.960
I'll have to live with you at home.

241
12:24.960 --> 12:26.000
I'm not used to it.

242
12:26.670 --> 12:28.600
Do you think I want to live with you?

243
12:28.670 --> 12:29.750
Hurry up and get discharged.

244
12:29.750 --> 12:30.810
Don't waste money.

245
12:32.510 --> 12:34.840
Look at your hair. It's like a bird's nest.

246
12:34.840 --> 12:36.120
You haven't been home in days, right?

247
12:36.120 --> 12:37.390
Where have you been messing around?

248
12:37.390 --> 12:38.390
I was busy with work

249
12:38.390 --> 12:39.870
and stayed at the hospital.

250
12:39.870 --> 12:40.510
Do you think

251
12:40.510 --> 12:41.710
everyone is like you?

252
12:42.840 --> 12:44.320
Didn't you tell me that

253
12:44.320 --> 12:45.920
you didn't want to work here?

254
12:46.030 --> 12:46.670
It's all because

255
12:46.670 --> 12:47.790
of your female boss

256
12:47.960 --> 12:49.490
who cornered me at my place.

257
12:50.870 --> 12:51.670
Oh, right.

258
12:51.780 --> 12:52.990
[Non-Smoking Ward]

259
12:52.510 --> 12:53.480
How are you two doing?

260
12:53.480 --> 12:54.810
How far have you gotten?

261
12:55.030 --> 12:55.960
I really didn't expect

262
12:55.960 --> 12:58.090
Ai Chen to actually take a fancy to you.

263
12:58.600 --> 12:59.400
You lucky dog.

264
13:00.000 --> 13:01.270
Stop gloating.

265
13:01.510 --> 13:02.150
Want me

266
13:02.150 --> 13:03.880
to give you another operation?

267
13:05.200 --> 13:06.150
So you've been staying

268
13:06.150 --> 13:07.550
in the hospital to hide from her?

269
13:07.550 --> 13:08.320
You know what?

270
13:07.640 --> 13:13.130
[Non-Smoking Ward]

271
13:08.320 --> 13:09.840
You're completely wrong.

272
13:10.200 --> 13:11.000
Ai Chen is someone

273
13:11.000 --> 13:13.080
who gets things done super fast.

274
13:13.630 --> 13:14.720
If she hasn't come for you,

275
13:14.720 --> 13:15.360
it only means that

276
13:15.360 --> 13:16.840
she has other things to deal with.

277
13:16.840 --> 13:17.960
If she wants to find you,

278
13:17.960 --> 13:19.440
hiding in the hospital is useless.

279
13:19.440 --> 13:20.790
Even if you hide in a cellar,

280
13:20.790 --> 13:22.190
she can still dig you out.

281
13:25.840 --> 13:27.480
Why are you laughing while they are talking?

282
13:27.480 --> 13:28.030
No.

283
13:28.790 --> 13:30.270
I've never seen

284
13:30.910 --> 13:32.600
a man hiding from a girl.

285
13:32.840 --> 13:33.910
Look at this man.

286
13:34.750 --> 13:36.410
This girl must be really ugly.

287
13:37.270 --> 13:37.840
It's not

288
13:37.840 --> 13:39.240
your place to judge Chen.

289
13:39.790 --> 13:41.190
You're wrong about that.

290
13:41.440 --> 13:42.370
She is gorgeous.

291
13:43.960 --> 13:45.030
You're definitely not

292
13:45.030 --> 13:47.320
as experienced as I am when it comes to this.

293
13:47.320 --> 13:48.360
My advice is

294
13:48.600 --> 13:50.080
to exchange sincerity for sincerity.

295
13:50.080 --> 13:52.080
Rejection is also a kind of sincerity.

296
13:52.080 --> 13:54.080
It's best to make everything clear.

297
13:54.080 --> 13:55.940
There's nothing wrong with that.

298
13:57.630 --> 13:58.440
Yeah,

299
13:59.240 --> 14:00.870
since you exchanged so much sincerity,

300
14:00.870 --> 14:01.840
how come you didn't have

301
14:01.840 --> 14:02.750
anyone else to sign

302
14:02.750 --> 14:03.750
for you in the end?

303
14:05.720 --> 14:06.720
That's a good one!

304
14:12.840 --> 14:13.630
Yaxin.

305
14:15.630 --> 14:17.200
You are my daughter.

306
14:19.240 --> 14:20.440
I have no one but you.

307
14:22.750 --> 14:24.120
So what if I'm your daughter?

308
14:24.120 --> 14:27.120
Does being your daughter mean I owe you for a lifetime?

309
14:32.670 --> 14:34.080
If you had saved some sincerity

310
14:34.080 --> 14:35.480
for your family earlier,

311
14:36.480 --> 14:37.440
you wouldn't have

312
14:37.440 --> 14:39.040
ended up in this state today.

313
14:44.150 --> 14:45.120
What now?

314
14:49.550 --> 14:50.550
Well, um.

315
14:52.030 --> 14:53.120
That was a little harsh.

316
14:53.120 --> 14:54.320
That's just how he is,

317
14:54.480 --> 14:55.840
speaking with low EQ.

318
14:55.910 --> 14:56.840
Don't take it to heart.

319
14:56.840 --> 14:58.440
Stop talking nonsense.

320
14:59.030 --> 15:00.120
You know nothing.

321
15:01.270 --> 15:02.670
It occurred to me that...

322
15:04.200 --> 15:05.600
Chief Physician Tong...

323
15:05.750 --> 15:06.200
Here.

324
15:06.670 --> 15:08.000
He told me yesterday...

325
15:08.360 --> 15:09.090
He told me...

326
15:11.910 --> 15:12.790
I might

327
15:13.240 --> 15:15.000
no longer be able to have as much fun

328
15:15.000 --> 15:16.120
as I used to.

329
15:17.240 --> 15:19.600
I feel really terrible...

330
15:19.870 --> 15:20.790
Old pervert,

331
15:21.080 --> 15:22.840
you really deserve it.

332
15:57.960 --> 15:59.220
Do you have any tissue?

333
16:18.750 --> 16:22.200
Why am I stuck with a dad like this?

334
16:25.550 --> 16:27.360
When I needed him,

335
16:28.390 --> 16:30.240
he was messing around out there,

336
16:30.840 --> 16:31.970
nowhere to be found.

337
16:33.200 --> 16:35.080
Now that he needs me,

338
16:35.480 --> 16:37.960
I have to forgive him and take care of him.

339
16:38.670 --> 16:39.440
Otherwise,

340
16:40.080 --> 16:40.630
I will be

341
16:41.200 --> 16:42.120
heartless.

342
16:42.390 --> 16:44.030
Why?

343
16:44.550 --> 16:46.840
And you insisted on getting me here

344
16:47.000 --> 16:49.270
and making me sign for him...

345
17:05.000 --> 17:06.310
As doctors,

346
17:06.680 --> 17:07.480
it's our duty

347
17:07.480 --> 17:09.000
to save him.

348
17:10.109 --> 17:12.109
But for you,

349
17:12.790 --> 17:14.030
it's indeed unfair.

350
17:22.440 --> 17:24.160
I'm not blaming you guys.

351
17:25.510 --> 17:26.510
I just...

352
17:27.510 --> 17:30.550
don't know how to face him.

353
17:32.830 --> 17:34.070
Then don't face him.

354
17:35.110 --> 17:36.030
Leave Fucheng,

355
17:36.200 --> 17:37.930
and you won't feel bad anymore.

356
17:41.720 --> 17:42.510
Kid.

357
17:45.270 --> 17:46.070
Comrade,

358
17:46.310 --> 17:48.170
I'm here to make contact with you.

359
17:48.240 --> 17:49.640
Codename, Nightingale.

360
17:49.960 --> 17:52.240
You've got to come with me to the operation site now.

361
17:52.240 --> 17:53.240
Right over there.

362
17:53.270 --> 17:54.440
Over there. There is

363
17:54.440 --> 17:55.550
a comrade like you

364
17:55.720 --> 17:57.050
who needs your support.

365
17:59.000 --> 17:59.640
Comrade...

366
17:59.640 --> 18:00.680
What are you doing?

367
18:00.680 --> 18:01.810
Why did you come out?

368
18:01.830 --> 18:03.160
Did you take your pills?

369
18:03.440 --> 18:04.700
Look at what time it is.

370
18:05.200 --> 18:06.400
Is it time?

371
18:07.030 --> 18:07.590
Comrade.

372
18:08.480 --> 18:09.110
Thank you.

373
18:09.440 --> 18:10.350
T-Take care.

374
18:11.830 --> 18:13.160
You must take care, kid.

375
18:16.960 --> 18:17.680
Be careful.

376
18:18.550 --> 18:19.480
Slow down a bit.

377
18:19.720 --> 18:20.920
Watch your step.

378
18:21.720 --> 18:22.400
Sorry,

379
18:22.880 --> 18:24.270
there are too many insane people

380
18:24.270 --> 18:25.270
in this hospital,

381
18:25.640 --> 18:27.100
and your dad is one of them.

382
19:14.070 --> 19:15.240
Zhengliang, let's eat.

383
19:15.240 --> 19:15.640
No waiting.

384
19:15.640 --> 19:17.240
Coming. Here you are.

385
19:17.240 --> 19:18.370
Here comes the dish.

386
19:21.240 --> 19:22.640
Zhengliang, make yourself at home.

387
19:22.640 --> 19:24.070
It's just simple, homemade food.

388
19:24.070 --> 19:24.680
Eat more.

389
19:24.680 --> 19:26.540
Let's eat. Help him get some food.

390
19:29.680 --> 19:30.200
Here.

391
19:31.680 --> 19:32.880
Thank you, Mrs. Zhou.

392
19:34.310 --> 19:35.310
See if you like it.

393
19:36.350 --> 19:37.240
Not bad, huh?

394
19:37.240 --> 19:38.000
It's so good.

395
19:43.160 --> 19:43.890
Zhengliang.

396
19:45.200 --> 19:46.130
What do you think

397
19:46.790 --> 19:48.120
of Xiaoximen Hospital?

398
19:48.680 --> 19:49.790
Very unprofessional.

399
19:49.790 --> 19:50.400
See?

400
19:50.960 --> 19:53.760
It definitely can't compare to those in Shenzhen.

401
19:55.270 --> 19:56.920
Then why did you come back?

402
19:57.960 --> 19:59.590
Do you have any plans

403
19:59.590 --> 20:00.920
for your career path?

404
20:02.160 --> 20:02.830
Do you have

405
20:02.920 --> 20:03.830
any plans?

406
20:03.880 --> 20:05.030
He's eating.

407
20:05.200 --> 20:06.660
Let's not talk about work.

408
20:07.440 --> 20:08.440
Zhengliang, eat up.

409
20:08.440 --> 20:09.300
Help yourself.

410
20:09.480 --> 20:11.000
No, I just thought

411
20:11.680 --> 20:12.640
Zhengliang could share

412
20:12.640 --> 20:14.160
some of his experiences out there with us,

413
20:14.160 --> 20:15.750
so your son could learn from him,

414
20:15.750 --> 20:16.280
you know?

415
20:16.310 --> 20:17.710
What can I learn from him?

416
20:18.240 --> 20:19.570
He should learn from me.

417
20:20.790 --> 20:22.120
Learn how to idle about.

418
20:23.350 --> 20:24.960
He doesn't learn good things himself

419
20:24.960 --> 20:26.350
and is even dragging others down with him.

420
20:26.350 --> 20:27.350
I'm speechless.

421
20:28.160 --> 20:29.550
Didn't we agree not to scold him before outsiders?

422
20:29.550 --> 20:30.160
Well...

423
20:31.070 --> 20:33.130
How could Zhengliang be an outsider?

424
20:33.440 --> 20:35.030
They grew up together.

425
20:35.070 --> 20:36.350
When they were little...

426
20:36.350 --> 20:37.590
He always copied your homework when you were little,

427
20:37.590 --> 20:38.310
right?

428
20:39.400 --> 20:40.750
Don't act as if you didn't know

429
20:40.750 --> 20:41.830
what your son is like.

430
20:41.830 --> 20:42.640
What am I like?

431
20:42.640 --> 20:44.000
I think I'm pretty good.

432
20:44.000 --> 20:45.200
You think you're good.

433
20:45.200 --> 20:46.880
Without me, you couldn't do any work

434
20:46.880 --> 20:47.880
or know how to do it.

435
20:47.880 --> 20:48.510
Come on...

436
20:48.510 --> 20:49.830
I can do anything.

437
20:50.110 --> 20:52.000
I said long ago I didn't want to study medicine,

438
20:52.000 --> 20:53.130
but you forced me to.

439
20:53.270 --> 20:54.200
I wanted to do something else,

440
20:54.200 --> 20:55.750
and you said I wasn't on the right path.

441
20:55.750 --> 20:58.080
For the past few years we worked together,

442
20:58.110 --> 21:00.310
Dad, have you ever praised me even once?

443
21:00.400 --> 21:01.240
When I did well,

444
21:01.240 --> 21:02.070
you said nothing.

445
21:02.070 --> 21:02.750
When I did poorly,

446
21:02.750 --> 21:04.270
you scolded me harshly.

447
21:04.960 --> 21:05.830
What's the worst part?

448
21:05.830 --> 21:06.640
At work,

449
21:07.310 --> 21:08.920
when we got into an argument,

450
21:09.160 --> 21:10.510
you'd take off your belt to whip me

451
21:10.510 --> 21:12.400
in front of all the young colleagues!

452
21:12.400 --> 21:13.880
Mom, don't I have any pride?

453
21:13.880 --> 21:14.940
Alright, alright.

454
21:15.070 --> 21:16.880
Wait until I go to Xiaoximen Hospital.

455
21:16.880 --> 21:17.790
Let's see how you control me.

456
21:17.790 --> 21:18.720
Xiaoximen Hospital?

457
21:18.720 --> 21:20.650
What proper doctor would go there?

458
21:23.720 --> 21:25.580
Zhengliang, he didn't mean that.

459
21:27.270 --> 21:28.070
No, no.

460
21:28.200 --> 21:30.550
Liu Zhengliang is also working at Xiaoximen!

461
21:30.550 --> 21:31.790
I'll resign tomorrow!

462
21:31.790 --> 21:32.920
How dare you resign?

463
21:33.440 --> 21:34.880
Why are you saying this again?

464
21:34.880 --> 21:35.920
I'll tell you one more thing.

465
21:35.920 --> 21:36.680
If you dare to resign,

466
21:36.680 --> 21:38.410
then don't ever come back here.

467
21:42.830 --> 21:44.090
Then I'll give it a try.

468
21:45.720 --> 21:47.110
Junnan, where are you going?

469
21:47.110 --> 21:47.640
You...

470
21:48.440 --> 21:49.240
Look at you.

471
21:50.750 --> 21:51.550
Zhengliang.

472
21:52.400 --> 21:53.330
Liu Zhengliang.

473
21:54.440 --> 21:54.970
Let's go.

474
21:56.310 --> 21:57.510
Mr. Chen, Mrs. Zhou,

475
21:57.640 --> 21:59.040
I'll visit you next time.

476
22:06.830 --> 22:07.920
What did you do?

477
22:12.270 --> 22:13.800
Did that scare you just now?

478
22:14.640 --> 22:16.440
My dad has always been like this.

479
22:16.750 --> 22:18.610
He's always yelling and furious.

480
22:19.240 --> 22:20.040
You know what?

481
22:21.240 --> 22:23.040
He's just used to being a leader.

482
22:24.960 --> 22:26.000
He and my mom

483
22:27.030 --> 22:28.480
either hold me down

484
22:28.750 --> 22:31.030
or make me learn the hard way.

485
22:31.030 --> 22:33.160
Not to mention his desire for control.

486
22:33.510 --> 22:34.270
Since I was a kid,

487
22:34.270 --> 22:36.270
he's never asked me what I actually like.

488
22:36.270 --> 22:38.110
I've thought about it many times.

489
22:38.110 --> 22:39.830
How great it would be if he wasn't my dad.

490
22:39.830 --> 22:41.360
What are you talking about?

491
22:41.550 --> 22:43.150
What's there to be scared of?

492
22:43.160 --> 22:45.020
I've seen enough of it growing up.

493
22:46.270 --> 22:47.400
But did you say

494
22:47.480 --> 22:48.510
you wanted to work

495
22:48.920 --> 22:50.160
at Xiaoximen out of anger?

496
22:50.160 --> 22:51.000
Nope.

497
22:52.270 --> 22:53.400
I've made up my mind.

498
22:55.070 --> 22:55.920
Why?

499
22:56.070 --> 22:57.000
No. 1 Hospital is so much better

500
22:57.000 --> 22:58.460
than Xiaoximen Hospital.

501
22:59.960 --> 23:00.550
Don't tell me

502
23:00.550 --> 23:01.480
you're really

503
23:01.480 --> 23:02.830
fooled by Long Dongdong's

504
23:02.830 --> 23:03.960
empty promises.

505
23:11.640 --> 23:13.570
It's not because of him, I promise.

506
23:15.030 --> 23:15.830
I just don't want

507
23:15.830 --> 23:17.760
to live in my dad's shadow anymore.

508
23:24.440 --> 23:25.970
You went to medical school.

509
23:28.550 --> 23:30.160
You did it out of interest.

510
23:33.000 --> 23:34.530
Yet I went to medical school

511
23:37.400 --> 23:39.460
because of my parents' arrangement.

512
23:43.030 --> 23:45.310
If I don't leave No. 1 Hospital,

513
23:49.480 --> 23:50.920
I will never escape

514
23:50.920 --> 23:51.960
his control.

515
23:53.720 --> 23:55.000
This is a good thing.

516
23:56.030 --> 23:57.510
He doesn't like me anyway.

517
23:57.920 --> 24:00.520
He always thinks I'm embarrassing him at work.

518
24:01.000 --> 24:02.660
I'll go to Xiaoximen Hospital

519
24:04.720 --> 24:05.850
and fend for myself.

520
24:06.750 --> 24:07.750
Isn't that great?

521
24:09.000 --> 24:10.000
It's not that bad.

522
24:15.830 --> 24:17.110
Just think it through

523
24:17.110 --> 24:18.240
and don't regret it.

524
24:20.270 --> 24:22.070
But let me make this clear first.

525
24:22.070 --> 24:23.070
I will definitely leave.

526
24:23.070 --> 24:24.130
It doesn't matter.

527
24:24.830 --> 24:26.400
I'm not going there for you.

528
24:26.880 --> 24:27.680
Good,

529
24:27.720 --> 24:29.920
I was just afraid you were coming for me.

530
24:34.350 --> 24:35.160
Waiter!

531
24:37.200 --> 24:38.960
Two more plates of meat, please.

532
24:38.960 --> 24:39.960
We still have some here.

533
24:39.960 --> 24:40.830
With so much meat,

534
24:40.830 --> 24:42.030
is it still not enough?

535
24:42.030 --> 24:43.760
I ordered more for Zhengguang.

536
24:44.350 --> 24:45.750
Why did you order for him?

537
24:46.510 --> 24:47.510
He's a grown man.

538
24:47.510 --> 24:48.880
Can't he get food himself if he's hungry?

539
24:48.880 --> 24:49.590
Thanks.

540
24:53.110 --> 24:53.920
Zhengliang.

541
24:56.400 --> 24:57.930
Most of us in our generation

542
24:59.550 --> 25:00.680
are only children.

543
25:01.640 --> 25:02.880
Only you have a brother.

544
25:02.880 --> 25:03.590
You have no idea

545
25:03.590 --> 25:04.960
how much our classmates

546
25:04.960 --> 25:06.160
envy you two.

547
25:06.200 --> 25:08.110
Yet you always get annoyed at him

548
25:08.110 --> 25:09.790
and think he's not good enough.

549
25:09.790 --> 25:11.200
Zhengguang is such a good boy.

550
25:11.200 --> 25:13.750
-We all see him as our own brother. -What's good about him?

551
25:13.750 --> 25:14.440
He's been

552
25:14.440 --> 25:15.970
bonkers with a sharp tongue

553
25:16.200 --> 25:16.960
since childhood.

554
25:16.960 --> 25:18.020
You're one to talk!

555
25:18.270 --> 25:19.590
You're even worse with your words.

556
25:19.590 --> 25:20.350
Alright, say no more.

557
25:20.350 --> 25:21.510
Come on, cheers.

558
25:36.830 --> 25:38.430
Actually, I really envy you.

559
25:59.720 --> 26:00.160
Hello?

560
26:00.750 --> 26:02.480
Hello, are you Liu Zhengliang?

561
26:02.830 --> 26:03.640
Yes.

562
26:11.510 --> 26:12.310
Zhengguang.

563
26:12.750 --> 26:13.550
What's up?

564
26:13.750 --> 26:15.790
We found your mother's body.

565
26:20.150 --> 26:21.600
[Blue Sky Rescue]

566
26:21.600 --> 26:27.520
[Police]

567
26:29.880 --> 26:30.310
No...

568
26:30.310 --> 26:30.830
I...

569
26:31.720 --> 26:33.180
Let me go in and take a look!

570
26:34.680 --> 26:36.000
That's my mom!

571
26:36.480 --> 26:37.340
Don't touch me!

572
26:37.590 --> 26:38.320
Hands off me!

573
26:38.350 --> 26:39.010
Alright...

574
26:39.030 --> 26:39.830
Mom!

575
26:40.070 --> 26:40.720
Mom!

576
26:44.720 --> 26:45.780
Come here and help!

577
26:52.580 --> 26:55.080
[Emergency]

578
26:56.680 --> 26:57.410
Zhengguang.

579
26:57.830 --> 26:58.640
Be careful.

580
26:58.750 --> 27:00.150
Slow down! Mind the step!

581
27:05.510 --> 27:06.480
Call me if anything happens,

582
27:06.480 --> 27:07.200
okay?

583
27:07.270 --> 27:08.510
Put the coat on him.

584
27:08.510 --> 27:09.160
Okay.

585
27:09.510 --> 27:10.160
Thank you. Thank you.

586
27:10.160 --> 27:11.310
Be careful.

587
27:30.640 --> 27:31.970
Aren't you getting off?

588
27:36.550 --> 27:38.830
The ice on the river hasn't completely melted yet.

589
27:38.830 --> 27:40.560
You're not getting off, right?

590
27:44.400 --> 27:45.550
How is my mom?

591
27:46.310 --> 27:47.110
Not too good.

592
27:50.350 --> 27:52.350
The body is decomposed and damaged.

593
27:53.640 --> 27:54.880
I have photos here.

594
28:00.480 --> 28:01.400
I'll go see her.

595
28:01.400 --> 28:01.930
No, no...

596
28:02.640 --> 28:03.590
Don't look!

597
28:05.480 --> 28:07.400
Zhengguang fainted after just one look.

598
28:07.400 --> 28:08.200
Don't go.

599
28:13.790 --> 28:14.790
Then I'll leave

600
28:15.000 --> 28:16.330
my mom's funeral to you.

601
28:20.680 --> 28:21.720
I'm a pro at this.

602
28:23.310 --> 28:25.110
I'll make sure it's a grand send-off.

603
28:25.110 --> 28:25.920
Don't bother.

604
28:26.030 --> 28:27.440
Just cremate her directly.

605
28:27.440 --> 28:28.590
Are you crazy?

606
28:29.680 --> 28:30.720
Cremate her directly?

607
28:30.720 --> 28:31.780
Isn't she your mom?

608
28:32.070 --> 28:34.200
Are you going to send her off like this?

609
29:58.400 --> 29:59.200
Hello?

610
29:59.640 --> 30:00.640
This is Mi Si.

611
30:01.160 --> 30:03.720
We've got the body at the funeral home.

612
30:04.480 --> 30:05.270
I know.

613
30:05.750 --> 30:07.070
Ai Chen messaged me.

614
30:07.750 --> 30:09.080
I heard from Ai Chen that

615
30:10.000 --> 30:11.800
you don't want to hold a funeral.

616
30:12.480 --> 30:13.750
It's mainly because of Zhengguang.

617
30:13.750 --> 30:15.280
He can't take any more hits.

618
30:15.720 --> 30:16.680
If another accident happens,

619
30:16.680 --> 30:18.140
it will be very dangerous.

620
30:20.960 --> 30:21.790
Besides,

621
30:22.240 --> 30:23.640
the way my mom looks...

622
30:25.240 --> 30:28.100
She probably froze as soon as she got into the water.

623
30:28.550 --> 30:30.480
Although the body is damaged a bit,

624
30:30.680 --> 30:32.240
the decomposition is not

625
30:32.550 --> 30:34.080
as terrible as we imagined.

626
30:34.720 --> 30:35.550
Ai Chen's dad,

627
30:35.550 --> 30:37.070
Ai Chen, and Zhuzi

628
30:37.200 --> 30:39.110
are working overtime to restore it.

629
30:39.110 --> 30:39.910
In my opinion,

630
30:40.480 --> 30:43.080
it's better to cremate her as soon as possible.

631
30:43.790 --> 30:44.590
Kid,

632
30:46.400 --> 30:47.200
funerals

633
30:48.110 --> 30:49.510
are for the living.

634
30:50.640 --> 30:51.960
Maybe you don't need it,

635
30:51.960 --> 30:53.110
but your brother

636
30:53.310 --> 30:54.770
and your mother's friends

637
30:55.590 --> 30:57.440
all want to see her off.

638
31:27.920 --> 31:28.850
Liu Zhengguang!

639
31:35.040 --> 31:39.670
[Fucheng City Taxi]

640
31:40.110 --> 31:41.040
Liu Zhengguang!

641
31:45.030 --> 31:45.960
Liu Zhengguang!

642
31:46.310 --> 31:47.240
Liu Zhengguang!

643
32:02.270 --> 32:03.750
I'm not going in there.

644
32:24.790 --> 32:26.850
It's on the 2nd floor of the east wing.

645
32:27.550 --> 32:29.680
Just turn right and go straight.

646
32:30.640 --> 32:32.750
I tried to stop him, but I couldn't.

647
32:33.830 --> 32:34.760
He's right here.

648
33:43.160 --> 33:43.960
It's done.

649
33:46.160 --> 33:47.290
Go in and take a look.

650
34:06.170 --> 34:09.489
[Keep quiet]

651
34:45.760 --> 34:47.620
She looks like she's just asleep.

652
34:51.710 --> 34:52.920
Great skills.

653
35:00.230 --> 35:03.360
Body storage is 720 yuan.

654
35:04.440 --> 35:06.800
Plus 700 yuan for cremation.

655
35:08.920 --> 35:11.510
We haven't picked the shroud and urn yet.

656
35:13.190 --> 35:15.630
I'll give you the cost price—1,500 yuan.

657
35:16.230 --> 35:19.150
Plus 500 yuan for the tombstone engraving.

658
35:20.550 --> 35:23.280
For wreaths, elegiac couplets, and signatures,

659
35:23.320 --> 35:26.000
I'll charge you 1,800 yuan.

660
35:27.030 --> 35:28.110
The total is...

661
35:29.550 --> 35:30.630
I will handle

662
35:31.030 --> 35:32.290
all these procedures.

663
35:33.230 --> 35:35.360
You just need to show up at the funeral.

664
35:36.400 --> 35:37.400
We don't need him.

665
35:38.280 --> 35:39.810
We don't need him to attend.

666
35:39.880 --> 35:40.880
Why are you going?

667
35:41.280 --> 35:43.210
What's the point of you attending?

668
35:43.230 --> 35:44.190
Up until now,

669
35:44.230 --> 35:45.920
he hasn't shed even a single tear.

670
35:45.920 --> 35:46.670
He is

671
35:46.670 --> 35:48.200
completely cold-blooded!

672
35:48.760 --> 35:49.840
He... He is still

673
35:49.840 --> 35:51.110
the Liu Zhengliang I know!

674
35:51.110 --> 35:52.440
He hasn't changed a bit!

675
36:02.150 --> 36:05.460
♪ The melting snow and the warm wind ♪

676
36:05.710 --> 36:08.010
♪ The flowers bloom again ♪

677
36:09.000 --> 36:10.550
The mother and son have been through a lot.

678
36:09.320 --> 36:15.100
♪ It's spring; it's a remedy ♪

679
36:10.960 --> 36:13.510
Duan puts up criticism posters every day.

680
36:13.960 --> 36:15.760
No one can talk sense into her.

681
36:16.630 --> 36:18.280
If it were any other child,

682
36:16.930 --> 36:20.540
♪ Stop and go, travelling separately ♪

683
36:18.590 --> 36:20.800
they would have been dragged down and given up long ago.

684
36:20.560 --> 36:22.880
♪ At the next intersection ♪

685
36:21.360 --> 36:22.360
But her son

686
36:22.510 --> 36:24.110
hasn't complained once.

687
36:24.530 --> 36:26.080
♪ You and I ♪

688
36:24.710 --> 36:25.920
It's been years,

689
36:26.070 --> 36:28.320
and he's been going everywhere with Duan.

690
36:27.960 --> 36:30.640
♪ Travel light ♪

691
36:31.910 --> 36:38.040
♪ Put the past weighing on my back into the moon ♪

692
36:39.390 --> 36:44.550
♪ Longing makes me wake up ♪

693
36:45.460 --> 36:49.150
♪ To the open window♪

694
36:50.030 --> 36:56.740
♪ Softly, the person in my dream is like the moonlight ♪

695
36:57.260 --> 37:01.430
♪ Falling on my heart softly and taking me ♪

696
36:58.690 --> 36:59.770
[Emergency Vehicle Access; No Parking]

697
37:01.450 --> 37:04.260
♪ To our old familiar place ♪

698
37:04.900 --> 37:11.310
♪ Slowly, the petals falls to the center of the lake when I miss you ♪

699
37:12.170 --> 37:16.240
♪ Ripples echo through the years, with our shadows faced each other ♪

700
37:16.620 --> 37:21.860
♪ We were together on the way we came ♪

701
37:35.070 --> 37:38.520
♪ The clouds bring the rain and the road turns ♪

702
37:38.910 --> 37:40.890
♪ Happiness is rare ♪

703
37:42.250 --> 37:47.980
♪ We'll meet and get separated ♪

704
37:49.930 --> 37:53.360
♪ I hope there's a mountain behind us ♪

705
37:53.550 --> 37:56.070
♪ With warmth in smiles ♪

706
37:57.040 --> 37:58.800
♪ Waiting for the wind to rise ♪

707
38:01.030 --> 38:03.440
♪ And waiting for the blue sky ♪

708
38:04.000 --> 38:05.070
I found my mom.

709
38:04.760 --> 38:08.080
♪ The breaths ♪

710
38:06.320 --> 38:07.590
Right on that river.

711
38:08.520 --> 38:10.890
♪ The ripples ♪

712
38:08.840 --> 38:10.900
That's where my dad passed away, too.

713
38:12.290 --> 38:17.780
♪ Wave after wave ♪

714
38:13.000 --> 38:14.280
Please wake up soon.

715
38:15.320 --> 38:16.360
I can leave

716
38:16.760 --> 38:17.840
when you're awake.

717
38:18.280 --> 38:22.320
♪ Time flies ♪

718
38:22.920 --> 38:29.510
♪ Softly, the person in my dream is like the moonlight ♪

719
38:30.200 --> 38:34.420
♪ Falling on my heart softly and taking me ♪

720
38:34.510 --> 38:36.970
♪ To our old familiar place ♪

721
38:37.760 --> 38:44.490
♪ Slowly, the petals falls to the center of the lake when I miss you ♪

722
38:45.040 --> 38:49.260
♪ Tell the stories in our memories, with our shadows faced each other ♪

723
38:49.540 --> 38:54.930
♪ We were together on the way we came ♪

724
39:20.630 --> 39:21.710
It's getting cold.

725
39:46.480 --> 39:48.710
I'm taking a long vacation starting tomorrow

726
39:48.710 --> 39:49.550
and going on a trip

727
39:49.550 --> 39:50.920
to relax.

728
39:50.960 --> 39:52.550
Breakfast is on me today.

729
39:53.670 --> 39:55.070
Bro, you...

730
39:55.070 --> 39:55.760
This is soy milk.

731
39:55.760 --> 39:56.440
Thank you.

732
39:57.230 --> 39:58.160
Get out of my way.

733
39:59.360 --> 39:59.760
Hey...

734
40:02.550 --> 40:03.950
This is millet porridge.

735
40:04.480 --> 40:06.280
I don't blame you for what happened that day.

736
40:06.280 --> 40:07.140
Have some buns.

737
40:24.630 --> 40:26.030
Do you want some vinegar?

738
40:26.550 --> 40:28.280
It tastes better with vinegar.

739
40:32.230 --> 40:33.290
Don't be like this.

740
40:34.510 --> 40:35.320
Everyone goes through

741
40:35.320 --> 40:36.590
tough times in life,

742
40:36.590 --> 40:37.230
right?

743
40:37.230 --> 40:38.440
Just like Dr. Che and me...

744
40:38.440 --> 40:39.440
Shut up.

745
40:40.150 --> 40:41.510
It's none of your business.

746
40:41.510 --> 40:43.190
You're always so hot-tempered.

747
40:43.190 --> 40:44.320
Can't you talk nicely?

748
40:44.320 --> 40:44.960
It has nothing to do with me!

749
40:44.960 --> 40:45.400
What's wrong?

750
40:45.400 --> 40:46.440
We can't talk nicely after the divorce,

751
40:46.440 --> 40:46.840
can we?

752
40:46.840 --> 40:47.590
When did I not talk nicely?

753
40:47.590 --> 40:48.280
You're the one talking rudely!

754
40:48.280 --> 40:49.840
I'm leaving! I'm leaving right now!

755
40:49.840 --> 40:50.770
Stay out of this.

756
40:50.880 --> 40:52.030
I really can't

757
40:52.030 --> 40:53.510
stay with her for one more day.

758
40:53.510 --> 40:54.590
Whatever!

759
40:54.880 --> 40:56.030
Nobody cares!

760
40:58.630 --> 41:00.070
You can still be friends.

761
41:10.760 --> 41:11.480
Dr. Liu,

762
41:11.670 --> 41:12.360
I have something

763
41:12.360 --> 41:13.590
to discuss with you.

764
41:14.110 --> 41:15.760
I want to apply for a Ph.D., right?

765
41:15.760 --> 41:16.400
I was wondering,

766
41:16.400 --> 41:17.280
if you're free,

767
41:17.280 --> 41:18.960
c-could you help me with my studies?

768
41:18.960 --> 41:19.690
Is that okay?

769
41:24.320 --> 41:25.720
I-It's fine if you can't.

770
41:25.800 --> 41:27.190
What I want to say is that,

771
41:27.190 --> 41:27.960
well,

772
41:27.960 --> 41:29.510
there are still many things you need to do.

773
41:29.510 --> 41:30.280
And many people

774
41:30.280 --> 41:31.150
need you, too.

775
41:31.150 --> 41:31.670
Okay.

776
41:33.840 --> 41:34.550
See?

777
41:34.550 --> 41:36.030
Dr. Liu is so generous,

778
41:36.030 --> 41:36.510
you know?

779
41:36.510 --> 41:38.800
E-Express your g-gratitude now!

780
41:38.800 --> 41:39.360
Huh?

781
41:40.320 --> 41:41.650
Look at me! So careless.

782
41:48.150 --> 41:49.950
I don't have anything valuable.

783
41:50.000 --> 41:51.440
Anyway, sometimes

784
41:51.440 --> 41:52.320
when I'm unhappy,

785
41:52.320 --> 41:53.510
I like to stare at this.

786
41:53.510 --> 41:54.190
Staring at it

787
41:54.190 --> 41:55.630
actually heals me a bit.

788
41:55.920 --> 41:56.760
If you don't mind,

789
41:56.760 --> 41:58.190
I'll give it to you.

790
41:59.000 --> 42:00.030
If you have something on your mind,

791
42:00.030 --> 42:00.510
looking at it

792
42:00.510 --> 42:02.110
can distract you,

793
42:02.110 --> 42:02.550
right?

794
42:03.480 --> 42:04.710
Snow... Snow...

795
42:04.880 --> 42:06.280
Snow...

796
42:06.280 --> 42:06.670
What is it?

797
42:06.670 --> 42:08.880
The ball... The ball has snow in it.

798
42:11.920 --> 42:13.720
Don't look at it. Let's not look.

799
42:14.590 --> 42:15.720
Let's not look at it.

800
42:26.550 --> 42:27.280
This door...

801
42:29.590 --> 42:30.760
H-He opened it, right?

802
42:30.760 --> 42:31.960
I saw him walking out.

803
42:36.030 --> 42:37.030
Wait, he opened it himself.

804
42:37.030 --> 42:38.360
He didn't react at all.

805
42:38.960 --> 42:40.070
When I mentioned the PhD exam just now,

806
42:40.070 --> 42:41.530
he had no reaction either.

807
42:43.480 --> 42:45.340
Can he see patients in this state?

808
42:59.920 --> 43:00.630
Dr. Liu...

809
43:00.630 --> 43:01.630
MkvDrama.net
